ep, pick next graders by uncovered class) is already implemented by rounds 62–67 — verify that reading against the files.\n5. Write W/SourcesRows.md: the S240 row draft, the lesson skeleton path, the considerthese verdict lines, and `DRAFTS ready=<n>`.\n\nLane bounds: leaf member — no subagent dispatch.\nJudged on: coverage, calibration\nMilestone: kengaku r68 w1 (v1, 12 seats: build + attack): R68-C1 pypi-server corrected stderr re-freeze (coverage, L0-capped); R68-C2 round-67 routed defects as dated corrections (calibration); frontier drafts and source open\n\nReport: write your scoped findings to .ufo/waves/round-68/w1/SourcesRows.md"
